==Russian==
[[Image:Hamstercage.jpg|thumb|Кле́тка]]

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|ru|клѣ́тка||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{inh+|ru|orv|клѣтъка}}, from {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*klětъka}}, from {{m|sla-pro|*klětь}} / {{m|sla-pro|*klětъ}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|кле́тка}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-клетка.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|кле́тка|*|adj=кле́точный|dim=кле́точка}}

# [[cage]], [[coop]], [[cell]]
#: {{coi|ru|[['''кле́тка''' Фараде́я]]|[[Faraday cage]]}}
# [[square]], [[check]] ''(checkered pattern)''
#: {{coi|ru|[[в кле́тку]]|[[quad ruled]]; quadrille ruled}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[бума́га]] [[в]] '''кле́тку'''|quadrille ruled paper; quad ruled paper; graph paper}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[тетра́дь]] [[в]] '''кле́тку'''|quadrille ruled notebook; quad ruled notebook}}
# {{lb|ru|biology}} [[cell]]
#: {{coi|ru|[[стволо́вая кле́тка]]|[[stem cell]]}}

